    "cost_closing_html":  "About \u003cstrong\u003e$3.13 a bowl\u003c/strong\u003e for restaurant-style dan dan noodles. The takeout version runs $14 plus tip and delivery fees, and it shows up soggy half the time. Yours is fresher and 13 bowls deeper.",
